# Copy to .env and fill in. See docs/ai-log.md for the architecture history.
# The agent now loops (up to 10 steps) rather than doing one single-shot
# filter proposal, so the Agent model is called repeatedly per question --
# the fast/cheap model is the right default here for overall response time,
# and the loop's own self-correction (it sees each real query result before
# deciding the next step) compensates for a fast model occasionally
# mis-stating one step. Verification runs once, at the end, to sanity-check
# the finished answer against everything the loop actually gathered. Any
# valid xAI model id works; both can be set independently.
Llm__ApiKey=
Llm__Models__Agent=grok-4-fast
Llm__Models__Verification=grok-4-fast
